# i18n (pl / en)

- Supported languages: `pl`, `en` (`Language` in `@/types/project`). Default preference chain: stored → browser → `pl` (`detectPreferredLanguage`).
- UI strings: extend `LanguageContext` dictionaries; keep `pl` and `en` keys in sync.
- Routing: respect `LangLayout` / localized paths; use helpers from `src/lib/i18n.ts` (`isLanguage`, storage keys, etc.).
- SEO strings for routes belong in `src/lib/seo.ts`, not only in React context.
- Do not introduce a second i18n framework unless explicitly requested.
